            "review_title": "Review at Hai San Pho",
            "review_text": "Mike L\nTu Liem, Vietnam121 contributions\n0\nDisappointing delivery service\nSep 2020 • Family\nPreviously when eating in this restaurant the experience was excellent. This time we ordered home delivery. Snails, su su garlic stir fry, seafood fried rice and two female mud crabs Singapore chili style. The Grab bike got lost but eventually arrived. The side dishes were good but the star attraction turned out to be over cooked tamarind crab. Difficult to eat as the meat was stuck firmly to the shell. We called to ask why they sent the wrong dish and were told sorry it's a new chef.\nRead more\nWritten September 17, 2020",
