            "review_title": "Review at Hai San Pho",
            "review_text": "Stanley E\nKuching, Malaysia19 contributions\n0\nDisappointing\nNov 2019\nDinner in a group of four. Recommended by our guide based on reviews. \n\nThe restaurant is modern with good ambience. \n\nApart from the ambience, food is disappointing. The squid we ordered was tough and chewy. We took a few bites and left it unfinished. The prawns not that fresh. We guessed, been in the freezer. The fish is salty. Taste like salted fish. We told the lady Captain who tasted the fish and took it back to the kitchen. In less than 5 minutes it came back to our table, chef must have done something to it but its the same fish. We tasted it in the presence of the lady Captain and it was terrible. She said she will get it replaced. Fish never appeared and the lady Captain disappeared. After sometime we decided to pay for the bill and left. We were charged for all items ordered.\n\nPricey and there are better seafood place in Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 26, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
