            "review_title": "Review at Hai San Pho",
            "review_text": "Sascha E\nBlumberg, Germany352 contributions\n1\nSeafood restaurant\nMar 2018 • Business\nBig variety of fresh seafood. Choice is still in the aquarium. It is a big restaurant with reasonable drink menu as well. Very much close to Lotte Hotel. I went there as a single person which is difficult as fish and seafood orders are mostly made in kg or for a group of persons (1kg of squid for one person - good luck)But waiters could mange to provide different foods. I enjoyed it with the combination of fresh Sapporo beer. Good taste, very spicy if you wish and service try to speak English making you happy for ordering.\nRead more\nWritten March 19, 2018",
