            "review_title": "Review at Hai San Pho",
            "review_text": "Chi H\n1 contribution\n1\nA worthy experience\nJan 2018 • Friends\nI have visit many restaurant with the same atmosphere as Hai San Pho but most of the time they are more expensive. The restaurant seems to always have discount event - the one I was using was the discount for the crabs which is still running. We requested steamed crabs and crab curry. The steamed crabs dish was served fresh with the crab meat still juicy. The crab curry was a little bit strong but some of my friend who came from Korea were ok with the spicy flavor and were very enjoy the dish. We also order hot pot and they recommended grouper hot pot, which was very delicious. \nThe restaurant was very spacious and beautifully decorated, and the atmosphere was very friendly. The staffs were helpful and seemed to understand their menu. I would recommend more friends to come enjoy the place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 30, 2018",
