            "review_title": "Review at Hai San Pho",
            "review_text": "Tim C\nHong Kong215 contributions\n0\nBest seafood in Hanoi ?\nNov 2017 • Friends\nThat's what we were told by a local lady. Dinner included a lot of dishes - cockles, squid, crab, eel, fried rice, garlic bread and some other things which I have already forgotten. To be honest, I have eaten much better seafood in other parts of the world, so was not particularly impressed. The restaurant is very big, and quite noisy. Unfortunately, smoking is allowed ( or so it seems) and that was going on at the next table. I doubt that I will come back to HSP, but plenty of other people obviously like this place.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 9, 2017",
