            "review_title": "Review at Hai San Pho",
            "review_text": "S T\nSingapore, Singapore28 contributions\n1\nGreat Seafood\nSep 2017 • Business\nI have never seen a restaurant with so many live lobsters especially many of them are giants. The varieties of seafood is good. The food served were fresh and clean and the environment is very spacious and modern. The cooking is good except for the cheese oyster or perhaps any seafood with cheese. It lacks the usual great taste of good cheese used for seafood such as lobsters or prawns. The lobster legs were used to cook lobster porridge. For someone who is very fond of eating crab porridge, I find the lobster porridge unbeatable, the best seafood porridge I ever had in my life. It was very tasty with sweetness from the lobster meat, the smooth texture of the porridge is perfect. The crab curry is good though the curry powder used is a little strong in taste. What they need is fresh coconut milk to blend in. The sea food taste good eating together with a local favorite dish of steam vegetable. Look forward to visiting this place again to try the other dishes.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 3, 2017",
